   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The algorithm for creating graph colorings in the section Navigating Graphs involved coloring the vertex of highest degree first, coloring as many other vertices as possible each color from highest to lowest degree, then repeating this process for the remaining vertices.\n",
